  <wpt lat="54.488947" lon="-0.611364">
    <ele>26.46620945941278</ele>
    <name>The 199 steps</name>
    <cmt>These steps date from before 1370 and lead to the 12th century Church of St Mary</cmt>
    <desc>These steps date from before 1370 and lead to the 12th century Church of St Mary</desc>
    <sym>Scenic Area</sym>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="54.488628" lon="-0.609799">
    <ele>46.97042687710221</ele>
    <name>Church of St. Mary</name>
    <cmt>First founded in 1110</cmt>
    <desc>First founded in 1110</desc>
    <link href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/St_Mary&apos;s_Church,_Whitby"/>
    <sym>Building</sym>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="54.488861" lon="-0.606658">
    <ele>58.283911816762775</ele>
    <name>Whitby Brewery Tap Room</name>
    <cmt>If you believe me when I say that a pre-walk beer is a great thing, this place is a great start to your walk. They do very nice pizzas.</cmt>
    <desc>If you believe me when I say that a pre-walk beer is a great thing, this place is a great start to your walk. They do very nice pizzas.</desc>
    <link href="https://www.whitby-brewery.com/"/>
    <sym>Restaurant</sym>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="54.484845" lon="-0.589602">
    <ele>46.601734695349286</ele>
    <name>Saltwick Bay</name>
    <cmt>It&apos;s worth a wander down into the bay. At low tide, this is an amazing fossil hunting spot.</cmt>
    <desc>It&apos;s worth a wander down into the bay. At low tide, this is an amazing fossil hunting spot.</desc>
    <sym>Beach</sym>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="54.457744858331324" lon="-0.5546303200534908">
    <ele>113.3506287129706</ele>
    <name>The Coast Cafe Bar</name>
    <cmt>If you&apos;re hungry or thirsty this is a worthy diversion, an excellent breakfast if you&apos;re on your way early.</cmt>
    <desc>If you&apos;re hungry or thirsty this is a worthy diversion, an excellent breakfast if you&apos;re on your way early.</desc>
    <sym>Restaurant</sym>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="54.43253" lon="-0.534039">
    <ele>34.5523241154519</ele>
    <name>Robin Hoods Bay</name>
    <cmt>The steep hill down into the village is before you.</cmt>
    <desc>The steep hill down into the village is before you.</desc>
    <sym>Scenic Area</sym>
  </wpt>
